# KuCoin API v2 dev keys
# Create at https://www.kucoin.com/profile/apikey/new
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored - never commit real keys.
#
# NOTE: market data used by the spot list (/api/v1/symbols, /api/v1/market/allTickers)
# is PUBLIC and needs no keys at all. Keys are only required for signed (private)
# endpoints. Never ship a secret in a client build - proxy through your backend.
KUCOIN_API_KEY=
KUCOIN_API_SECRET=
KUCOIN_API_PASSPHRASE=
